      "claim": "The product label for alprazolam recommends women who are breastfeeding not use this medication. But the benefit of treating your condition and breastfeeding may outweigh possible risks of taking alprazolam. Your healthcare providers can talk with you about using alprazolam and what treatment is best for you. Be sure to talk to your healthcare provider about all your breastfeeding questions.",
